>**Raises nation's Production at the cost of Resources.**
=2 Walkthrough
* Gain your mission from {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}. Select __Supply Manufacture__, and mission __Iron Anvil IV__.
* Speak with {n:Adjutant} (F-9) for details. He will ask you which craft you want to assist him in.
* You will have to tell him the ingredients for **TWO** different recipes in the craft you have chosen.
** Time is limited when selecting {p:Crystals|Category:Crystal} and ingredients.
** You will fail the mission if you take too long to select the {p:Crystals|Category:Crystal} and ingredients or choose the wrong ones.
** Recipes will require up to **Eight** ingredients. If a recipe has less than **Eight** ingredients, it is necessary to select the __"No more ingredients are required"__ option after selecting the appropriate ingredients.
* **NOTE: **The order is not necessarily the same as provided in the list below, BE AWARE!
* Report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to complete the mission.

=2 Notes
* Minimum Craft Skill required to attempt this is 61.

