=2 Game Description
\**Client:** ({n:Emhi Tchaoryo}){br} **Summary:**
To manufacture munitions and supplies, our nation has employed hundreds of guildworkers of various skill levels. You are to lend your trade knowledge to help improve quality and productivity. Speak with the {n:Adjutant|Adjutant (Windurst)} (F-9) for details.
